/ UTM<span class="ml-2 normal-case tracking-normal font-normal text-slate-600">120 zones. Open, or type a zone such as 32N</span></button></div></div><div class="border-t border-slate-800 p-2 space-y-1"><button type="button" class="w-full text-left px-1 py-1 hover:bg-slate-800 text-sm text-slate-400">Local engineering grid (no geodetic placement)</button><button type="button" class="w-full text-left px-1 py-1 hover:bg-slate-800 text-sm text-amber-300">I do not know the CRS (placement stays unverified)</button><button type="button" class="w-full text-left px-1 py-1 hover:bg-slate-800 text-sm text-cyan-400 flex items-center"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="w-3.5 h-3.5 mr-1"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg>Custom definition (proj4 or WKT)</button></div></div></div></div><button type="button" data-testid="undefined-open-in" title="Open this well in another Geoscience app" class="flex items-center gap-1 px-2 py-1 text-xs rounded border border-slate-700
            text-slate-300 hover:text-slate-100 hover:bg-slate-800 disabled:opacity-40 " id="radix-ID" aria-haspopup="menu" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="w-3.5 h-3.5"><path d="M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"></path><polyline points="15 3 21 3 21 9"></polyline><line x1="10" x2="21" y1="14" y2="3"></line></svg> Open in <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="w-3 h-3 opacity-70"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button><div class="space-y-2" data-testid="well-import"><div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-2"><input class="rounded-md bg-slate-950 border border-slate-700 text-slate-200 px-1.5 py-1 text-xs" placeholder="Well name *" data-testid="well-import-name" value=""><input class="rounded-md bg-slate-950 border border-slate-700 text-slate-200 px-1.5 py-1 text-xs" placeholder="UWI (optional)" value=""><label class="text-xs text-slate-400 flex items-center gap-1">KB, TD in<select class="rounded-md bg-slate-950 border border-slate-700 text-slate-200 px-1.5 py-1 text-xs" data-testid="well-import-depthunit" title="Unit of the KB and TD you type. Stored in metres."><option value="m">metres</option><option value="ft">feet</option></select></label><input class="rounded-md bg-slate-950 border border-slate-700 text-slate-200 px-1.5 py-1 text-xs" placeholder="KB m above datum" data-testid="well-import-kb" title="Kelly bushing elevation above the (seismic) datum" value="0"><input class="rounded-md bg-slate-950 border border-slate-700 text-slate-200 px-1.5 py-1 text-xs" placeholder="TD m MD (vertical wells)" data-testid="well-import-td" title="Required only when no deviation survey is pasted; defaults to the last station otherwise" value=""></div><div class="rounded border border-slate-800 bg-slate-950/40 p-2 space-y-2"><div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-slate-400">Surface location<button type="button" class="px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded border text-xs border-cyan-500/60 text-cyan-300" data-testid="well-loc-xy">Projected XY</button><button type="button" class="px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded border text-xs border-slate-700 text-slate-400" data-testid="well-loc-latlon">Lat / Lon (WGS 84)</button></div><div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-2 items-start"><div class="col-span-2"><div class="relative"><button type="button" class="w-full rounded-md bg-slate-950 border border-slate-700 text-slate-200 p-2 text-sm text-left disabled:opacity-50">Choose a coordinate reference system</button></div></div><input class="rounded-md bg-slate-950 border border-slate-700 text-slate-200 px-1.5 py-1 text-xs" placeholder="Surface X *" data-testid="well-import-x" value=""><input class="rounded-md bg-slate-950 border border-slate-700 text-slate-200 px-1.5 py-1 text-xs" placeholder="Surface Y *" data-testid="well-import-y" value=""><label class="text-xs text-slate-400 flex items-center gap-1 col-span-2">Values are in<select class="rounded-md bg-slate-950 border border-slate-700 text-slate-200 px-1.5 py-1 text-xs" data-testid="well-import-xyunit"><option value="m">metres</option><option value="ft">feet</option><option value="ftUS">US survey feet</option></select></label></div></div><div class="flex items-center gap-1"><button type="button" data-testid="well-tab-deviation" class="px-2 py-1 text-xs rounded border border-cyan-500/60 text-cyan-300">Deviation</button><button type="button" data-testid="well-tab-tops" class="px-2 py-1 text-xs rounded border border-slate-700 text-slate-400">Tops</button><button type="button" data-testid="well-tab-checkshots" class="px-2 py-1 text-xs rounded border border-slate-700 text-slate-400">Checkshots</button><label class="ml-auto text-xs text-slate-400 cursor-pointer hover:text-slate-200">Load file…<input type="file" accept=".csv,.txt,.dev,.tsv,text/*" class="hidden"></label></div><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 text-xs text-slate-400"><label class="text-xs text-slate-400 flex items-center gap-1">Survey MD in<select class="rounded-md bg-slate-950 border border-slate-700 text-slate-200 px-1.5 py-1 text-xs" data-testid="well-import-devunit"><option value="m">metres</option><option value="ft">feet</option></select></label></div><textarea class="rounded-md bg-slate-950 border border-slate-700 text-slate-200 px-1.5 py-1 text-xs w-full h-24 font-mono" placeholder="Paste the deviation survey (MD, inclination, azimuth)… leave empty for a vertical well" data-testid="well-import-text"></textarea><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-medium ring-offset-slate-900 transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-blue-500 focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 h-9 rounded-md px-3 bg-cyan-600 hover:bg-cyan-500 text-white" data-testid="well-import-save"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="w-4 h-4 mr-2"><path d="M19 21H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h11l5 5v11a2 2 0 0 1-2 2z"></path><polyline points="17 21 17 13 7 13 7 21"></polyline><polyline points="7 3 7 8 15 8"></polyline></svg>Save well</button></div>"
`;
